1. Force change tools.profile to "minimal"
2. Disable auto update
3. Turn off redundant logs
4. Apply the config and restart the gateway

The config they provided is:
```json
{
  "tools": {
    "profile": "minimal",
    "allow": ["taskflow", "acp-router"],
    "deny": ["*"]
  },
  "updates": {
    "autoUpdateEnabled": false
  },
  "logging": {
    "level": "warn"
  }
}
```

